	)
	(text "USB: 22 V flat-clamp TVS, a 4.7 uF + 1 R snubber and a TPS259470A eFuse (cut-off 5.4 V, 1.5 A). Solar and drone: 33 V TVS and a 60 V MAX17608 (cut-off 10 V, 0.71 A, blocks -60 V and reverse current)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
