	(text "Drive: SX1262 +11 dBm -> 30 dBm (1 W), +17 dBm -> ~35 dBm (3 W). The 15.9 dB pad keeps the amplifier input below its +13 dBm limit even at the SX1262 maximum (+22 dBm -> +6 dBm)."
