	(text "Mesh Radio v1 (working name) - OffGrid Devices\nLoRa 902-928 MHz mesh radio, up to ~3 W; Bluetooth LE; one LiPo cell; USB-C, solar and drone power.\nNDAA-ready parts list: every part from a US / EU / Japan / Taiwan / Korea / Norway maker.\nEach box below is one page. Every connection is a named label; the same name is the same wire.\nThis drawing is generated from src/circuit.py by src/sch.py: change the code, not the drawing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
